# top-level file comment
use skill by3gus/pdf-processing # inline use comment
use service github://openhat/caps/services/github@main
use slash https://toolang.ai/review
use psyche toolang.ai/reviewer

service github: ```md # inline declaration header comment
Use this service when the agent needs GitHub access.
```

psyche reviewer: ```md
Prefer concrete findings and direct language.
```

stash session: ```json
{}
```

struct ReviewFinding:
  path: string
  line: number? # inline struct field comment

struct ReviewResult:
  summary: string
  findings: ReviewFinding[]

slash review(path, focus?): # inline slash header comment
  Review {{path}} carefully. # inline slash body comment
  {{focus}}

thunk review(input, path?: path, focus?) -> ReviewResult: # inline thunk header comment
  model = gpt-5 # inline directive comment
  psyches = reviewer, concise
  skills += review, patch
  services -= linear
  tools = shell, service_use

  Review the target carefully. # inline thunk body comment

  Return a precise result.
